msgid "Zactonz Lite"
msgstr ""

#. Theme URI of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "https://developers.zactonz.com/wordpress/themes/zactonz-lite/"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A featherweight block theme for publishers who care about page weight. It ships no stylesheet request of its own, because WordPress inlines its styles, and its default style uses the reader's system font so no web font is downloaded at all. Eight templates, three style variations and a set of patterns cover a blog or a small site out of the box. Structured data, meta tags and caching are deliberately left to the plugins that specialise in them."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Zactonz Technologies"
msgstr ""

